					<div class="ekit-wid-con" ><div class="ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-"><h1 class="ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title "> <span>Your Future Starts</span> here at FTCC</h1></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-faa7c81 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="faa7c81" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1523622 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1523622" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Embarking on your educational journey at FTCC is simple and rewarding. Follow our step-by-step guide to explore programs, apply, and enroll.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1729a3d elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget-elementskit-dual-button-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-dual-button" data-id="1729a3d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-dual-button.default">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" >
                <div class="ekit-element-align-wrapper">
                    <div class="ekit_double_button">                <a class="ekit-double-btn ekit-double-btn-one" href="https://faytechcc.edu/apply-now/">
                    Apply Today!                </a>
            
            <a class="ekit-double-btn ekit-double-btn-two" href="https://faytechcc.edu/about-us/visit-campus/">
                    Visit FTCC                </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
            </div>				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-29947f9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="29947f9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d6fb8e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading" data-id="d6fb8e0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-heading.default">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" ><div class="ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_center   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-"><h2 class="ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title ">Unlock Your Potential on an<br /><span>Extraordinary Journey</span></h2><div class="ekit_heading_separetor_wraper ekit_heading_elementskit-border-divider elementskit-style-long"><div class="elementskit-border-divider elementskit-style-long"></div></div>				<div class='ekit-heading__description'>
					<p>At Fayetteville Technical Community College, learning meets innovation, and endless possibilities. We're a dynamic hub of academic excellence in southeast North Carolina. We take pride in nurturing the next generation of leaders, thinkers, and changemakers. Through educational excellence and world-class research, we are building a brighter, safer world for the people of North Carolina, the nation and beyond.</p>
				</div>
			</div></div>				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-28f4807 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="28f4807" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-787fb13 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading" data-id="787fb13" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-heading.default">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" ><div class="ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_center   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-"><h2 class="ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title ">Academic <span>Pathways</span> </h2><div class="ekit_heading_separetor_wraper ekit_heading_elementskit-border-divider elementskit-style-long"><div class="elementskit-border-divider elementskit-style-long"></div></div></div></div>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3d7505b e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child" data-id="3d7505b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
