                <div class="elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center">

                    <img decoding="async" width="400" height="267" src="https://faytechcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/College-Student-Smiling-While-wearing-a-book-bag-and-holdin-gbooks-400x267.png" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-205272" alt="" srcset="https://faytechcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/College-Student-Smiling-While-wearing-a-book-bag-and-holdin-gbooks-400x267.png 400w, https://faytechcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/College-Student-Smiling-While-wearing-a-book-bag-and-holdin-gbooks-540x360.png 540w, https://faytechcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/College-Student-Smiling-While-wearing-a-book-bag-and-holdin-gbooks-200x133.png 200w, https://faytechcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/College-Student-Smiling-While-wearing-a-book-bag-and-holdin-gbooks.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" />
                </div>
                
                <div class="elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body">
                    <div class="elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner">
                                                <h3 class="elementskit-info-box-title">

                        Diplomas
                        
                    </h3>
                                                            <div class="elementskit-box-style-content">
                        Diploma programs provide students with focused, career-oriented education that builds practical skills and foundational knowledge for entry into professional and technical fields.                    </div>
                                    </div>

