				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-681a15b elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="681a15b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><style>
.ftcc-campus-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding-left: 0;
}

.ftcc-campus-list li {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.ftcc-campus-list a {
  color: #f1b825;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.ftcc-campus-list a:hover,
.ftcc-campus-list a:focus {
  color:#ffffff;
}
</style></p>
<h2 data-start="148" data-end="191">One College. Multiple Campuses.</h2>
<p data-start="193" data-end="460">Fayetteville Technical Community College offers instruction and training across several campuses and specialized off-campus facilities throughout the Fayetteville area. Each location is designed to support specific programs, hands-on learning, and workforce training.</p>
<p data-start="462" data-end="612">Whether you’re attending classes on campus or training at one of our specialized centers, FTCC provides the resources and support you need to succeed.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9fd3c27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9fd3c27" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
