<li><a href="https://faytechcc.edu/contact/collision-repair-refinishing-technology-center/">Collision Repair &amp; Refinishing Technology Center &gt;&gt;</a></li>
<li><a href="https://faytechcc.edu/contact/horticulture-education-center/">Horticulture Educational Center &gt;&gt;</a></li>
<li><a href="https://faytechcc.edu/contact/fort-bragg-center-2/">Fort Bragg Center &gt;&gt;</a></li>
<li><a href="https://faytechcc.edu/contact/fire-rescue-training-complex/">Fire &amp; Rescue Training Complex &gt;&gt;</a></li>
<li><a href="https://faytechcc.edu/contact/law-enforcement-management-training-center/">Law Enforcement &amp; Emergency Management Training Center &gt;&gt;</a></li>
